  aciklama:
  - "Fal\u0131nda \xE7\xF6z\xFClen \"bilinmezlik\" bu\u011Fusunun hemen ard\u0131nda,
    yara bere i\xE7inde kalm\u0131\u015F bir \xE7ift el var {{isim}}. \U0001F450O
    kadarla kalsa iyi; tamamen \xE7amura bulanm\u0131\u015F, kurumu\u015F, yani son
    derece h\u0131rpalanm\u0131\u015F bu eller. Nedense bu g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC bana,
    \xFCnl\xFC Frans\u0131z yazar Andr\xE9 Malraux'un \u015Fu s\xF6z\xFCn\xFC hat\u0131rlatt\u0131:
    \"La libert\xE9 n'a pas toujours les mains propres.\" Yani, \"\xF6zg\xFCrl\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    elleri\" daima temiz de\u011Fildir. \U0001F91BKendi kaderini t\u0131rnaklar\u0131nla
    kaz\u0131yaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hissediyorum. Bireysel ve ekonomik \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC
    kazanmak i\xE7in \xF6ncesinde hayal bile etmedi\u011Fin olanaklarla kar\u015F\u0131la\u015F\u0131p
    bunlar\u0131 ba\u015Far\u0131yla de\u011Ferlendirecek, kendindeki olumlu de\u011Fi\u015Fimlere
    \u015Fa\u015F\u0131racaks\u0131n."
